mia and constitutional symptoms, but requires specific evidence not present", "Chronic Inflammatory Syndrome: systemic inflammation as alternative to malignancy, but blast cells suggest acute process"], "alarm_features": ["Night sweats", "Unintentional weight loss", "Fever of uncertain origin", "Pancytopenia with blasts"]}, "branches": {"B1": {"id": "B1", "label": "Reactive / Non-malignant Leukocytosis", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "reopened", "prior": 0.1514145133021391, "posterior": 0.3214910770980377, "danger": 0.3, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": ["The presence of blasts and pancytopenia is more consistent with myeloid neoplasm (B2) than lymphoid or plasma cell disorders. This finding moderately supports …"], "evidence_against": ["No specific evidence is identified that directly contradicts the myeloid neoplasm hypothesis (B2). The findings remain neutral for B2 but continue to reduce li…"], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 2.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.1, "interrupt_relevance": 0.2, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "mechanism", "representative_diseases": []}, "B2": {"id": "B2", "label": "Myeloid Neoplasm with Increased Blasts", "level": 1, "status": "parked", "posterior": 0.021, "danger": 0.8, "parent": "ROOT", "closure_reason": "", "evidence_against": []}, "B3": {"id": "B3", "label": "Lymphoid Neoplasm with Increased Blasts", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "reopened", "prior": 0.2568682535945858, "posterior": 0.46940638499537735, "danger": 0.7, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": ["The presence of blasts and pancytopenia is more consistent with myeloid neoplasm (B2) than lymphoid or plasma cell disorders. This finding moderately supports …"], "evidence_against": ["No single finding decisively contradicts the myeloid neoplasm hypothesis (B2). Pancytopenia with